POST /jobs
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOi...
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "input": "このデータを分析してください。"
}

Response:

202 Accepted
{
  "jobId": "01J9ABCDEF1234567890",
  "status": "QUEUED",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-07T07:45:00+09:00"
}

⸻

